# Build context for the server image. Measured before writing this: the bare
# repo is ~700MB, almost all of it irrelevant to `cargo build -p server`.
#
# Deliberately NOT excluded, because the build depends on them:
#   .sqlx/     committed offline query cache (the build has no database)
#   .cargo/    sets SQLX_OFFLINE=true for the workspace
#   engine/    a workspace member, so cargo parses its manifest and infers its
#              lib target even though `-p server` never compiles it

# Build output
target/
**/target/

# Frontend — not part of the Cargo workspace since src-tauri was removed
apps/host/

# Large data the server build never reads
songs/
engine/assets/

# Repo furniture
.git/
.github/
.gitignore
docs/
scripts/
*.md
LICENSE*

# Agent / local tooling
.claude/
.superpowers/

# Never bake local credentials into the image
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
